# Two sibling clones that are deliberately NOT submodules.
#
# kstart is frozen C legacy. Its only remaining job is to build the C kdaemon
# and C kallosctl that scripts/verify.sh diffs the Rust ports against, and its
# install.sh is the rollback path. Nothing in a session touches it, and
# verify.sh already skips the parity block when its binaries are absent — so a
# machine set up from this repo simply doesn't get those checks.
#
# kbrowser has no git remote at all yet. It can become a submodule once it is
# pushed somewhere.
/kstart/
/kbrowser/
